Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.20,H_id,,0,0,0,,"Kasur hangat pertama di dunia beku... seluruh desa langsung MEREBUT"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:44.20,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.16,S_id,,0,0,0,,Astaga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.10,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tuan Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.24,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kau seperti dewa yang turun ke bumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.28,0:00:04.36,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku tak pernah membayangkan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.84,S_id,,0,0,0,,kalau tidur di dipan tanah ini
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.08,S_id,,0,0,0,,bisa sehangat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:09.00,S_id,,0,0,0,,Semalaman hangat — tulang tua aku dah longgar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:10.56,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kita tak akan takut dingin lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.52,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dengan batubara hitam ini
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:12.76,S_id,,0,0,0,,dan dipan hangat ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.70,S_id,,0,0,0,,musim dingin kita
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.64,S_id,,0,0,0,,aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.68,0:00:16.04,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku yang lihat duluan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.08,0:00:17.80,S_id,,0,0,0,,Aku menggalinya dari salju sedikit demi sedikit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:18.84,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lalu kenapa harus milikmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Omong kosong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hormati yang tua!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.54,0:00:24.02,S_id,,0,0,0,,Barang berharga begini
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.22,S_id,,0,0,0,,seharusnya jadi milik kami yang tua
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.26,0:00:27.90,S_id,,0,0,0,,untuk selamat di musim dingin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.34,S_id,,0,0,0,,Itulah yang benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.42,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dasar tua sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:31.38,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kau mencuri HIDUPKU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.32,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kembalikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:33.38,S_id,,0,0,0,,Berani-beraninya kau pukul aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.03,0:00:36.03,S_id,,0,0,0,,Itu semua harta!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:36.97,S_id,,0,0,0,,HARTA semuanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.31,S_id,,0,0,0,,Kenapa satu orang saja yang pegang?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.35,0:00:39.25,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bagi sama rata!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.29,0:00:40.19,S_id,,0,0,0,,Bagilah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.32,S_id,,0,0,0,,Lepaskan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:44.20,S_id,,0,0,0,,Beri aku!
